{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Inc</strong> is an addictive <strong>incremental</strong> <strong>fishing</strong> game! Catch fish, earn cash, and unlock powerful skills. Master new ponds, fill your Fish Log with Legendary catches, and become the ultimate angler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Fish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to many of the locations and catch all the fish in the areas! To catch fish you will need to click till you reach the goal target before you lose the fish!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/02a834d3443ed2cfa9fa74b57b95f36d.avif?t=1762028606\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Log Your Catches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time you will get better at catching certain species of fish, you will learn their tricks and it will let you catch bigger and higher quality fish! You will discover many fish species as you travel trough the fishing locations!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/471e790baa32d270ec21dcf7a52000ec.avif?t=1762028606\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To become the best fisherman you will need all the best gear and upgrades, once you come back from your fishing trips you can spend your hard earned money on many upgrades that will help you catch bigger and more exotic fish\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/bc0ee55394b3cfe0a940b8d1f2f53f39.avif?t=1762028606\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126480?t=1762028606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126480?t=1762028606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/6dc42ef282519a5f48bc9ff2cfd01f46d2e431f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762028606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/6dc42ef282519a5f48bc9ff2cfd01f46d2e431f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762028606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Inc</strong> is an addictive <strong>incremental</strong> <strong>fishing</strong> game! Catch fish, earn cash, and unlock powerful skills. Master new ponds, fill your Fish Log with Legendary catches, and become the ultimate angler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Fish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to many of the locations and catch all the fish in the areas! To catch fish you will need to click till you reach the goal target before you lose the fish!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/02a834d3443ed2cfa9fa74b57b95f36d.avif?t=1762028606\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Log Your Catches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time you will get better at catching certain species of fish, you will learn their tricks and it will let you catch bigger and higher quality fish! You will discover many fish species as you travel trough the fishing locations!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.st